Copied/modified: native/core.c (duplex.c, symbol isolation, integer observation,
compatible-position indexing, exact generic-loop factoring, position/storage
layout, process-owned reusable workspace, algebraic density dispatch and loop
control, parameter-derived conservative loop-energy bounds and suffix-block pruning with unchanged traceback); native/energy.h (exact internal/exterior energy specialization derived
from eval_internal.c and eval_exterior.c).
Copied unchanged: native/upstream/RNAduplex.c, RNAduplex_cmdl.c/h,
RNAduplex.ggo, gengetopt_helpers.h, ViennaRNA/intern/color_output.h.

The extension and packaged fallback executable statically link the existing
ViennaRNA 2.7.2 RNAlib. See COPYING.ViennaRNA for its redistribution terms.
